    {
      "id": "293bcc36-72d9-4686-a52c-ef1695e10a53",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "blue",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left",
        "level": 2,
        "isToggleable": false
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Step 1: Paper Sketch",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "b69140be-0d9d-4bb9-a08b-3738decd8a18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Based on the various features and pages you described in the feature spec, draw up sketches of each view. Napkin style quick sketches are a good place to start. Focus more on thinking through the common actions that the users will be making rather than how and where the buttons go. As you draw out these sketches with your team several things will come to light, features you might have missed or interactions that need to be changed. ",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "8b43c0ce-c59d-4bea-a86f-d084a730bdde",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Time to take the abstract to concrete. Sketch rough layouts of screens focused on ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "features",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ".",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "df55fdac-78ad-4c9e-9c59-840b7d1c7cc3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "b1d3f034-b882-47a2-b257-6a04cbb6361f",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left",
        "level": 3,
        "isToggleable": false
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Generate options as a group",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "9cb05721-b265-4cf7-bb91-4f0ebe2252a9",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Determine which ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "(2-5) main features",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " you will sketch that are essential to your product (e.g. the feed, leaderboard, comments, etc)",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "6f1d5f30-4a21-4910-8650-103ef10f9f92",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Get thick markers, printer paper, and designate a timekeeper",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "6fff2240-bd2f-4290-bdd8-82c8d381dd4c",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Allow for ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5 minutes of individual sketching per feature",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ", working on as many unfiltered iterations as possible in that time limit. Treat this much like improv - try not to self-edit or rule out anything just yet.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "c04bb4a8-e40a-4969-bbfe-098a822d2145",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "After each round, compare sketches and create a few group versions that incorporates the best of all the ideas. Actively agree/disagree with specific elements. Aim for ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2-3 versions per feature",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ".",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "989db380-207e-4392-9517-a60a2a01c38a",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "0180a974-8540-4e07-ba8d-e04ed700fece",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left",
        "level": 3,
        "isToggleable": false
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Rules",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "7fcbe028-4683-4a8c-9fba-8f10d6ddd1a3",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Use the \"thick marker trick\" - the thicker the marker, the more you force yourself to keep the designs at a conceptual level the better. Whiteboard markers are great here too, just take photos!",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "c07393d8-2aaa-4ffb-b895-c97360a9f464",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Include little or no specific content",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "b89bf271-6b3c-492b-a03a-729bd8b8bc8d",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Drop any worries about scale, straight lines, grids, etc.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "64e82f9f-8cf1-4a1c-9d99-8f3c44a8f382",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Think in flows whenever possible (what views or steps come after?)",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ca9c8f7d-da6a-4b79-9a10-d2ad4d09de00",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Match your sketches with your flow diagram - what part of the flow is not yet in the sketch?",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "019c0f8c-174c-4765-818a-de2393d90fd9",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Never settle for your first idea!",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
