          }
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2d6ba9c3-d140-4de7-9629-b85cc6ad972e",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Use your AI tool to generate screens for all the views and functionality in your feature spec.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "1f394de2-53e3-4c34-8edb-43e688d20029",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Start from your feature spec",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " - don't just generate random screens. Use the user flows and features you already defined to guide your prompts.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "37b823ec-947e-4a51-8634-6a7231d1a3b8",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Cover all key screens",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " - onboarding, main views, detail views, settings, error states, empty states, etc.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "829d0fac-6a1c-4e2c-afd6-efba54ec755c",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Think about the user journey",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " - what is the action on each screen? What screens are missing to make the experience complete?",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "e4d4acf0-a757-47ee-a021-9711499c6a50",
      "type": "paragraph",
