      },
      "content": [],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "8a66987a-a327-4ad7-a49c-5cf3cc0335ea",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "blue",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left",
        "level": 2,
        "isToggleable": false
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Step 4: Iterate and Refine",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "44227c74-061c-418c-afc6-417e70f1abf1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "AI-generated designs are a starting point, not the final product. Your job is to shape them.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "78f32ba3-1d97-4a12-b6bf-0ec442b7a865",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Iterate, don't accept the first output",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " - run at least 2-3 iterations per major screen. Refine your prompts, adjust layouts, and improve the UX.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "49f58ea7-f6b8-4bf6-a8af-7318aaf201c3",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Critique the AI output",
          "styles": {
